  "name": "30th Celebration First Partner Special Illustration Holo Set Vol. 2",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "A set sold in mainland China from 19 June 2026, the second of three 30th Celebration First Partner Special Illustration Holo Sets (30周年庆典 最初的伙伴特别插画闪卡套装 Vol.2). Each held one of nine special illustration holos at random, all printed in equal numbers, with an acrylic magnetic card display frame and a 5-card Stellar Crystal pack. The nine are the first partners of three regions: Chikorita, Cyndaquil and Totodile of Johto; Snivy, Tepig and Oshawott of Unova; Grookey, Scorbunny and Sobble of Galar. Side by side, each region's three make one long picture, full of places and things from its games.",
